luci-app-hsgq-ddm
Optical diagnostics for HSGQ / ODI DFP-34X GPON SFP sticks on OpenWrt.

This product is a modified version of luci-app-vsol-ddm
  https://github.com/AliLostInTheDark/luci-app-vsol-ddm
